<div class="stats-grid"><% for(const[key,label,icon]of[['total','Total produk','engine'],['published','Produk terbit','published'],['available','Tersedia','check'],['unavailable','Habis','minus'],['categories','Kategori','tag'],['gallery','Foto galeri','image']]){ %><article class="stat-card"><div><span><%= label %></span><span class="stat-icon" aria-hidden="true"><%- include('admin-icon',{name:icon}) %></span></div><strong><%= stats[key] %></strong><small><%= key==='available'||key==='unavailable'?'Dari produk yang diterbitkan':'Tersimpan dalam database' %></small></article><% } %></div><section class="panel dashboard-products"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Terakhir diperbarui</h2><p>Perubahan terbaru pada katalog Anda.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="<%= adminPath('/admin/products') %>"><span>Semua Produk</span><span class="inline-arrow"><%- include('arrow',{direction:'up-right'}) %></span></a></div><%- include('admin-table') %></section><div class="dashboard-bottom"><section class="panel"><span class="eyebrow">KONTEN TOKO</span><h2>Informasi selalu terbaru.</h2><p>Perbarui profil dan kontak. Website publik menggunakan sumber data yang sama.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="<%= adminPath('/admin/about') %>">Edit About</a><a class="button" href="<%= adminPath('/admin/contact') %>">Edit Contact</a></div></section><section class="panel blue-panel"><span class="eyebrow">KATALOG PUBLIK</span><h2>Dari admin,<br>langsung ke pelanggan.</h2><p>Produk Published tampil di katalog. Draft tetap tersimpan di ruang admin.</p><a class="button" href="/products" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>Lihat Katalog</span><span class="inline-arrow"><%- include('arrow',{direction:'up-right'}) %></span></a></section></div>
